## Command

```shell
biome check --write file.svelte
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "html": {
    "formatter": { "enabled": true },
    "linter": { "enabled": true },
    "experimentalFullSupportEnabled": true
  }
}
```

## `file.svelte`

```svelte
<script
	lang="ts"
	generics="TData extends { selected?: boolean; name?: string }, TRow"
>
let { items, selected }: { items: TData[]; selected: TRow } = $props();
</script>

<p>{items.length}{selected}</p>

```

# Emitted Messages

```block
Checked 1 file in <TIME>. Fixed 1 file.
```
